<section id="A1.SS8.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.8.2 </span>List of Tools Used in the Benchmark</h4>

<div id="A1.SS8.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS8.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following presents a comprehensive list of all tools used in our benchmark, categorized by their functional domain. Each tool is listed with its name and a brief description.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Domain: <span id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Map</span> (AMap Services and Google Maps Services)</h5>

<div id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Tools for geographic information and routing services within China, powered by the AMap server.</p>
</div>
