<section id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Domain: <span id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Medical/Biology</span> (Biomedical Research Services)</h5>

<div id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS8.SSS2.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Tools for searching and retrieving data from biomedical databases such as PubMed, ClinicalTrials.gov, and MyVariant.info.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T16" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T16.2" class="ltx_tabular">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T16.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T16.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T16.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tool Name</span></th>
<th id="A1.T16.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T16.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:218.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T16.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T16.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Description</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T16.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T16.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T16.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:198.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T16.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">search</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T16.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T16.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:218.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T16.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Universal search across all biomedical domains with unified query language.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T16.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T16.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T16.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:198.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T16.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">fetch</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T16.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T16.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:218.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T16.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Retrieve detailed information for any biomedical record; auto‑detects domain if not provided.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T16.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T16.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T16.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:198.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T16.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">article_searcher</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T16.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T16.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:218.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T16.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Searches PubMed/PubTator3 for research articles and preprints about genes, variants, diseases, or chemicals.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T16.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
